comments:
Thanks for pointing me in the right direction!

It looks like it was trying to read the following file, but that file was 0KB:
/config/.storage/esphome.dashboard

I deleted this file, remove the ESPHOME Addon, rebooted HA OS, re-added ESPHOME Addon, which recreated this file with 1KB:

{
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "key": "esphome.dashboard",
  "data": {
    "info": {
      "addon_slug": "aaaaaaaa_esphome",
      "host": "127.0.0.1",
      "port": 66666
    }
  }
}

And then I was able to add the discovered ESP devices.
